# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# clin_longsum .gitignore
# DUA NOTE: this project is developed against a PhysioNet-credentialed BHC source.
# NO patient-derived data may be committed -- initial, interim, or output. The
# rules below block all data artifacts by directory AND by extension, belt-and-braces.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Credentials / environment ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Data directories (default + every run namespace: data_<ns>/) ────────────────
data/
data_*/
**/data/
**/data_*/
output/
**/output/
src/studies/ledger_studies

# ── Patient-derived data files, wherever they land ──────────────────────────────
# The source CSV, cohort draws, per-stage JSONL, ledgers, eval outputs, review
# worklists -- all derived from the credentialed source. Blanket-block by extension.
*.csv
*.jsonl
*.parquet
*.feather

# Review-tool artifacts (generated from patient data). The clinical_review_tools/
# folder currently lives under src/, so the leading **/ is REQUIRED -- a rule with a
# mid-path slash but no leading **/ would anchor to the repo root and miss it.
# (*.csv / *.jsonl are already blanket-blocked above; these add .html/.docx/.xlsx.)
**/clinical_review_tools/**/*.csv
**/clinical_review_tools/**/*.jsonl
**/clinical_review_tools/**/*.html
**/clinical_review_tools/**/*.docx
**/clinical_review_tools/**/*.xlsx

# ── Curated reference asset that IS safe to ship ────────────────────────────────
# dictionary_abbreviations.tsv (UMLS-built abbreviation map; no patient data). It
# must live OUTSIDE data/ to be committable -- a file under an ignored directory
# cannot be re-included by git. The pipeline reads it from config.ABBREV_TSV
# (src/resources/). No blanket *.tsv rule is set, so it ships by default.
!**/dictionary_abbreviations.tsv

# ── Large model / binary artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.npy
*.faiss

# ── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── DUA audit scratch (ripgrep / Select-String hitlists may contain real identifiers) ─
dua_hits.txt
hitlist.txt
LICENSING.md

# ── OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local, un-shippable adjudications for the review tools (derived from credentialed data).
# review_merge_faithfulness.py imports this if present and merges it over the shipped template.
**/adjudications_local.py
